<section class="section wrap" id="elder-law" aria-labelledby="elder-h">
  <h2 id="elder-h">Built for elder law, not borrowed from litigation software.</h2>
  <p class="section-lead">Most practice management tools are designed around litigation. DossierIQ starts from the work elder law firms actually do: gathering a lifetime of records, proving five years of statements, and finding the accounts nobody wrote down.</p>
  <div class="specifics">
    <div><b>The 60-month look-back</b><span>Coverage tracked by account and by month, so gaps show up before the caseworker finds them.</span></div>
    <div><b>Medicaid packet export</b><span>Documents grouped by checklist item, with a cover sheet listing what's included and what's still missing.</span></div>
    <div><b>The digital estate</b><span>Upload a client's email export and DossierIQ surfaces online accounts and recurring charges, so subscriptions and accounts don't get missed.</span></div>
    <div><b>Your judgment stays in charge</b><span>DossierIQ organizes and flags; attorneys and staff confirm. It's guidance, not legal advice.</span></div>
    <div><b>Google Workspace and Microsoft 365</b><span>Keep documents in your firm's Google Drive or SharePoint, and sign in with a Google or Microsoft work account.</span></div>
  </div>
  <p class="closing">Behind every file is a family trying to get it right.</p>
</section>

<section class="section wrap" id="security" aria-labelledby="security-h">
  <h2 id="security-h">Your clients' documents stay yours.</h2>
  <p class="section-lead">Elder law files hold the most sensitive information a family has. We built DossierIQ with that in mind, and we'll only tell you what's true today.</p>
  <ul class="ruled ruled-2">
    <li><b>Firm-owned storage.</b> Documents are stored in your firm's own Google Drive or SharePoint, not in a DossierIQ warehouse.</li>
    <li><b>Secure sharing with a record.</b> Clean Room links expire, require a one-time code, and record every view and download in a tamper-evident log.</li>
    <li><b>Authority before access.</b> Sensitive discovery steps, like connecting a client's mailbox, require a recorded statement of the firm's authority first.</li>
    <li><b>Encrypted nightly backups.</b> Every night the DossierIQ server and database are backed up, encrypted, and copied off-site, in addition to daily, weekly and monthly copies kept locally. We've verified those off-site backups can be recovered.</li>
    <li><b>Encryption at rest for connections.</b> The keys DossierIQ uses to reach your storage are encrypted at rest.</li>
    <li><b>Credentials are never shared.</b> Documents marked as login credentials can't be sent through a share link or included in downloads.</li>
    <li><b>We don't sell your data.</b> Not your firm's, not your clients'.</li>
  </ul>
  <p class="fine">Questions about how DossierIQ handles data? Email <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a> and we'll walk you through it.</p>
</section>

